# AuthorDataClassifications: stepper on DataClassification of the GovernanceRules accelerator.
_package: GovernanceRules.entities.DataClassification.steppers
_type: Stepper
_name: AuthorDataClassifications
description: 'Creates and edits data classifications (Create, Edit, Mass update and Import actions). Used by the governance steward, without workflow.'
